# Billing System (Flask)

A full-stack billing system built using Flask, MySQL, and JavaScript.

## Features
- Product management (Add/Edit/Delete)
- Real-time cart system
- GST calculation
- PDF invoice generation
- Billing history
- Stock management

## Tech Stack
- Python (Flask)
- MySQL
- HTML, CSS, JavaScript
- ReportLab (PDF generation)

